"P537417730" "The fate of Sir Lucane"
// DetailString :
"P1116090437" "You rescued Sir Lucane from the Animus Arcana and he has agreed to join you and Sir Bedwyr in your quest to uncover the sinister plot of the Talons of Vengeance."

