// Page CarlyleComplete Text :
"P2430601246" "The location of the meetin' will favor Lorn an' Lorn alone. I'll not risk my wax any more than this for the likes of you, outsider."
// Page CarlyleComplete SayOutLoudText :
"P2705782343" "The location of the meetin' will favor Lorn an' Lorn alone.<t 4>I'll not risk my wax any more than this for the likes of you, outsider.<t 0.1>"
// Page CarlyleIncomplete Text :
"P2461831383" "You've a lot of nerve comin' 'ere what with all the chaos your kind has brought. Spit your breath an' we'll 'ave a listen. Spend your breath wisely an' we'll deal. Waste my time an'... well... time is wax, chum, and at the moment you're simply worth more of it ta me dead!"
// Page CarlyleIncomplete SayOutLoudText :
"P3621738838" "You've a lot of nerve comin' 'ere what with all the chaos your kind has brought.<t 4>Spit your breath an' we'll 'ave a listen.<t 2>Spend your breath wisely an' we'll deal.<t 2>Waste my time an'... well... time is wax, chum.<t 3>And at the moment you're simply worth more of it ta me dead!<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P2983510583" "I need an audience with Lorn."
// Page NegotiatePage1 Text :
"P4079599901" "Black Knights, hrmm? What makes you think they'll deal with an outsider like you?"
// Page NegotiatePage1 SayOutLoudText :
"P3845447747" "Black Knights, hrmm?<t 4>What makes you think they'll deal with an outsider like you?<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P2256477191" "Our problem is their problem. It's in your best interest to find a way for us to talk, cordially."
// Answer Text :
"P2349804312" "Don't make me tell you twice."
// Page Peaceful Text :
"P110221711" "So... What the Black Knights seek 'ere in the Night Ward is responsible for our current <i>interruption of service</i>?<br><br>... Intriguing.<br><br><i>If</i> what you say is true then perhaps it <i>is</i> in everyone's best interest ta work together... Until the current crisis is averted, of course."
// Page Peaceful SayOutLoudText :
"P3147594070" "PLACEHOLDER: So... What the Black Knights seek 'ere in the Night Ward is responsible for our current interruption of  service?<t 4>... Intriguing.<t 2>If what you say is true then perhaps it is in everyone's best interest ta work together...<t 4>Until the current crisis is averted, of course.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P1892619422" "Of course..."
// Page Peaceful2 Text :
"P3878890234" "Ringing! Now then, I must press on this small matter of my compensation for my efforts.<br><br><color orange>Carlyle smiles a rotten toothy grin in your direction.</color><br><br>These <i>Talons of Vengeance</i> have proven ta be <i>most</i> vexing, stealin' souls that rightfully belong ta me... and The Taskmasters Office, of course. I ask that you only 'elp me deal with them before more profits are lost.<br><br>We both win: You gain in weakenin' your hated foe, while I retain possession of the souls which are rightfully mine.<br><br>Do we have a settlement upon our affairs?"
// Page Peaceful2 SayOutLoudText :
"P506102372" "Ringing!<t 2>Now then, I must press on this small matter of my compensation for my efforts.<t 5>These Talons of Vengeance have proven ta be most vexing, stealing souls that rightfully belon' to me... and The Taskmasters Office, of course.<t 6>I ask that you only help me deal with them before more profits are lost.<t 4>We both win:<t 2>You gain in weakenin' your hated foe, while I retain possession of the souls which are rightfully mine.<t 4>Do we have a settlement upon our affairs?"
// Answer Text :
"P2287171607" "We do."
// Page Peaceful3 Text :
"P908332003" "Splendid! I'll speak with Lord Lorn an' secure the audience you seek. Meanwhile, you deal with the Talon thieves and bring back the souls that are rightfully mine.<br><br>One addition. Know this, outsider. I do not take kindly to those whose deeds do not match their claims. If I smell betrayal at any point, you will suffer mightily.<br><br>The location of the meeting will favor Lorn and his Black Knights. I'll not dribble my wax any further for you than this. Prove yourself, and I'll consider adjustin' the boundaries of our association."
// Page Peaceful3 SayOutLoudText :
"P1726258703" "Splendid!<t 1>I'll speak with Lord Lorn an' secure the audience you seek.<t 3>Meanwhile, you deal with the Talon thieves and bring back the souls that are rightfully mine.<t 4>One addition.<t 2>Know this, outsider.<t 2>I do not take kindly to those whose deeds do not match their claims.<t 4>If I smell betrayal at any point, you will suffer mightily.<t 3>The location of the meeting will favor Lorn and his Black Knights.<t 3>I'll not dribble my wax any further for you than this.<t 3>Prove yourself, and I'll consider adjustin' the boundaries of our association.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P4220382951" "You need not worry, Carlyle, everything is well in hand."
// Page PeacefulFinish Text :
"P856364347" ""
// Page Aggro Text :
"P3722972235" "Ask. Tell. It makes no difference ta me, outsider.<br><br>I'll secure you an audience with Lord Lorn, but you'd best mind your tongue wit' 'im, or he'll make certain it is removed along with your 'ead!<br><br>First, however, I require of you a favor in exchange for this... service."
// Page Aggro SayOutLoudText :
"P3370323451" "Ask.<t 1>Tell.<t 1>It makes no difference to me, outsider.<t 3>I'll secure you an audience with Lord Lorn.<t 3>But you'd best mind your tongue wit' 'im, or he'll make certain it is removed along with your 'ead!<t 6>First, however, I require of you a favor in exchange for this... service."
// Answer Text :
"P2200733382" "Betray me, Carlyle, and it will be your head at my feet."
// Page Aggro2 Text :
"P901415760" "Shrewd. I enjoy that.<br><br>I have a matter involvin' our shared enemy - The Talons of Vengeance. They 'ave seen fit ta steal souls, rightfully belongin' ta The Taskmasters Office, an' they're costin' us quite a bit of wax doin' it.<br><br>Now, unless I judged you wrong, I believe you would simply <i>excel</i> in sendin' them a message that lets them know just how unwelcome such behavior is.<br><br>Yes?"
// Page Aggro2 SayOutLoudText :
"P2048813275" "Shrewd.<t 1>I enjoy that.<t 2>I have a matter involvin' our shared enemy - The Talons of Vengeance.<t 4>They have seen fit ta steal souls, rightfully belongin' ta The Taskmasters Office.<t 5>And they're costin' us quite a bit of wax doing it.<t 3>Now, unless I judged you wrong, I believe you would simply excel in sendin' them a message that lets them know just how unwelcome such behavior is.<t 6>Yes?"
// Answer Text :
