// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3906664988" "Look upon me and know that I am Sir Pendragon<t 3>Born of death, Black Knight of the Eternal Order, sworn protector of the Eternal Prison, Shield of the Black Queen, and oathsworn to Lord Lorn - the Black Warden.<t 8>I shall meet your challenge, Outsider, and we shall see if you are made of more than words.<t 4>"
