// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P441536726" "You convinced the Black Knights, through words and swords, that your warning is to be trusted. Lorn has tasked you with discovering proof of the Talon plot to breach the Eternal Prison."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2410005622" "You passed the Trial by Steel? Against Pendragon?!<br><br>Excellent work! Perhaps Lorn and the Black Knights are not in danger as I'd feared. We shall search for solid proof of this Talons plot and then Lorn will surely listen.<br><br>I know not what the Talons are planning to accomplish by turning the souls of the dead into more of their agents of suffering, but it must have something to do with their plan to open the Eternal Prison. I believe that only you can help me stop this madness, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - GithredeonDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Page1 Text :
"P3632321195" "I smell the brimstone on you, Outsider... But you're no Black Knight..."
// Answer Text :
"P317207234" "One sent me to find you... Bedwyr."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P1394457178" "Calling on my debt to him... fine... what's your quarry?"
// Answer Text :
"P1860459884" "The Talons of Vengeance, I need help tracking them down."
// Page Page3 Text :
"P2985762923" "Talons, huh? Heh... You did right coming to me.<br><br>I've  hunted Talons... Dangerous prey... But you want more than just to hunt them... Don't you?"
// Answer Text :
"P3625870869" "I believe they are planning on corrupting the Black Knights."
// Page Page4 Text :
"P2404553011" "Black Knights... heh... Funny that. A contingent made out of their camp for the Vale not an hour ago.<br><br>If they aren't corrupted already, they soon will be. That siren song sings and <i>fwip</i> they'll turn on each other.<br><br>Turned my hounds on me ... I had to put 'em down. Only me and Three Jaguar's left...<br><br>I got no love for the Talons... and no love of the Vale either. This's your hunt... and I'll leave you to it."
// Answer Text :
"P2963277438" "Fine, where did they go?"
// Page Page5 Text :
"P4002503066" "Some caves throughout the Vale... Talons all over this one.<br><br><color orange>Githredeon  draws you a rudimentary map on a piece of hide.</color><br><br>I think it's some sort of nest... wouldn't go there if I were you.<br><br>Heh, but then again, I'm not, am I?"
// Answer Text :
"P244012268" "No, you aren't. Thanks for the tip."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CarlyleDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page NotTaskOwnerPage Text :
"P2171680145" "<color orange>"Only your team leader may speak to Carlyle."</color>"
// Page CarlyleComplete Text :
"P2567512388" "Go and find the Black Knights and get this over with. Until then, I'm finding myself a nice cozy place to lay low until this all blows over. I'd suggest you do the same, but you're the one who's got to fix this mess."
// Page CarlyleComplete SayOutLoudText :
"P55503860" "Go and find the Black Knights and get this over with.<t 3>Until then, I'm finding myself a nice cozy place to lay low until this all blows over.<t 3>I'd suggest you do the same, but you're the one who's got to fix this mess.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P4184732032" "Always a pleasure, really."
// Page CarlyleIncomplete Text :
"P987650918" "Why, thank you, {HeroName}. I don't know what's happened, but the Black Knights have declared martial law over the Night Ward, and what's worse, they've fired the entire Taskmasters Office!"
// Page CarlyleIncomplete SayOutLoudText :
"P2552399860" "Why, thank you, {HeroName}.<t 2>I don't know what's happened, but the Black Knights have declared martial law over the Night Ward, and what's worse, they've fired the entire Taskmasters Office!<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P3756768679" "That's unfortunate, but I need your help now."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P628748112" "Help? You need my help? Pah! If anyone needs help it's me! I'm nothing without my job, nothing I say!"
// Page Page1 SayOutLoudText :
"P864418926" "Help?<t 1>You need my help?<t 2>Pah!<t 1>If anyone needs help it's me!<t 2>I'm nothing without my job, nothing I say!<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P2721818208" "Help me and the Black Knights will leave."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P479589187" "Leave? What do you mean, leave? Like, forever?<br><br>Why, that would be dandy. What can I do?"
// Page Page2 SayOutLoudText :
"P4140997799" "Leave?<t 1>What do you mean, leave?<t 2>Like, forever?<t 2>Why that would be dandy.<t 2>What can I do?<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P843533579" "Some Black Knights abandoned the Order, help me find them."
// Page Page3 Text :
"P1978419270" "Ah ha... I like how you think, {HeroName}. Start a bit of a war within their own ranks, eh? Quite clever..."
// Page Page3 SayOutLoudText :
"P3973688147" "Ah ha... I like how you think, {HeroName}.<t 3>Start a bit of a war within their own ranks, eh?<t 3>Quite clever...<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P2874117988" "Carlyle, do you know or not?"
// Page Page4 Text :
"P250305795" "Oh, of course I know! It pays to keep your ear close to the dirt I always say. But... how much is it worth to you?"
// Page Page4 SayOutLoudText :
"P2909428753" "Oh, of course I know!<t 2>It pays to keep your ear close to the dirt I always say.<t 3>But... how much is it worth to you?<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P1818096513" "I just saved your life, how much is that worth to you?"
// Page Page5 Text :
"P87596090" "I wasn't in any real danger...<br><br><color orange>Carlyle smiles at you and then frowns.</color><br><br>Alright! Fine, fine. You did save me from torture and a slow, rotting decay. Your goals are also in line with my own, at least, as far as either of us can tell...<br><br>I've heard that four well respected Knights have left the Order and are questing across the Night Ward, or some such rubbish. I have it whistled down here somewhere.<br><br><color orange>Carlyle pats at his pockets before smiling satisfactorily and producing a small wooden <i>recorder</i> which he places to his lips and blows through lightly. The device repeats the report made to him by one of his underlings.</color><br><br><i>Sir Lucane is in The City of Souls seeking the Animus Arcana.<br><br>Sir Emric and those loyal to him are rumored to have traveled into the earth beneath The Digs to fight the Talons of Vengeance.<br><br>Sir Agnan and his squire were last heard from awaiting audience with the Taskmaster's Office.<br><br><color orange>Carlyle lowers the recorder and smiles.</color><br><br>That's all that I've heard."
// Page Page5 SayOutLoudText :
"P1850458660" "I wasn't in any real danger...<t 2>...<t 3>Alright!<t 1>Fine, fine.<t 2>You did save me from torture and a slow, rotting decay.<t 4>And your goals are in line with my own, at least as far as either of us can tell.<t 4>I've heard that four well respected Knights have left the Order and are questing across Night Ward, or some such rubbish.<t 4>I have it whistled down here somewhere.<t 2>...<t 3>Sir Lucane is in The City of Souls seeking the Animus Arcana.<t 4>Sir Emric and those loyal to him are rumored to have traveled into the earth beneath The Digs to fight the Talons.<t 6>Sir Agnan and his squire were last heard from awaiting audience with the Taskmaster's Office.<t 5>That's all that I've heard.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P1178310501" "That'll do, Carlyle. That'll do."
// Page Page6 Text :
"P530194719" "Now stick up to your end of the bargain and undo this madness you Outsiders have plagued us with. First we can't make shipments, and now we've been downsized. The Taskmaster's Office will not get involved with a war, {HeroName}. The sooner one side or the other has the decency to die, the sooner things can get back to normal around here!"
// Page Page6 SayOutLoudText :
"P1545741528" "Now stick up to your end of the bargain and undo this madness you Outsiders have plagued us with.<t 4>First we can't make shipments, and now we've been downsized.<t 3>The Taskmaster's Office will not get involved with a war, {HeroName}.<t 3>The sooner one side or the other has the decency to die, the sooner things can get back to normal around here!<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P514363122" "Always a pleasure, Carlyle."
// Page CarlyleStillCaptured Text :
"P2472830750" "Ah! This fighting is making me very nervous!"
// Answer Text :
"P4216410586" "Relax, this'll be over in a second..."
// Page Fallback Text :
"P1742468745" "Now stick up to your end of the bargain and undo this madness you Outsiders have plagued us with. First we can't make shipments, and now we've been downsized.<br><br>The Taskmaster's Office will not get involved with a war, {HeroName}. The sooner one side or the other has the decency to die, the sooner things can get back to normal around here!"
// Answer Text :
"P2946541245" "Always a pleasure, Carlyle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3619306502" "We must find proof of the Talons plot to breach the Eternal Prison. If we can provide that, then Lorn will have no choice but to turn the might of the Black Knights against them. I believe I know someone who will be able to help you track the Talons down."
// AcceptString :
"P804139141" "Oh yeah, who's that?"
// SendOffString :
"P3052218697" "His name is Githredeon, and he is a <color red>Spirit Stalker</color>, a deadly spirit that hunts the souls of the dead.<br><br>I saved his life from the Talons, I have no doubt that he'll be looking for an opportunity to pay back his debt as quickly as possible. The spirit stalkers are loathe to owe anyone anything. They take what they need and exist only for the hunt. The only thing they respect is strength."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2205614646" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Changing of the Guard</color>"

