// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3993615359" "Gorgon"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1287426046" "Death isss too good for them!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P811431074" "How considerate of them to deliver fresh meat!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P267455591" "Tonight we feast!"
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P1127431811" "Hello, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3384723901" "Such fools, do they not understand that we are doom incarnate?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P270675321" "Ah, more servants of the oathbreaker!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2051210943" "Siren"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3148716173" "Dread Templar"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P4248931064" "More lambs to the slaughter!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1241215469" "Why resist the innevitable?"
