// - ScriptDef - OnEnterObjectiveComplete 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - ObjectiveTrigger 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P313682577" "Enough! You've made your point, just put your swords away and let's talk like civilized folk."
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2372869188" "{HeroName}! No, you'll just make them angry again!"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P147444957" "<t 5>The Taskmaster's Office works for us now, taskmaster.<t 5>And you will address me as 'sir'.<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4021298805" "Ah, Pendragon's vanquisher is here.<t 3>Good, I look forward to testing my steel!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P437049138" "Things are getting out of hand."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScriptCarlyleRescued 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P511098256" "Find Taskmaster Carlyle"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4192271623" "Halt!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P893595209" "You rescued Carlyle from the Black Knights and their declaration of martial law on the Drudges here in Night Ward. To repay you, Carlyle has told you everything he knows about the rogue Knights that his Drudges have heard about in Night Ward."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P18595609" "My word. Only Lorn could have declared martial law. Whatever deception is being orchestrated around Lorn is worse than I could imagine. To drive away his own sword brothers and then declare martial law on the Drudges. Whoever is behind this is manipulating him keenly. We must hurry to rally my brothers. Only by standing together will Lorn see that he has no choice but to listen to our words and together discover he who is not our brother."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - LucaneDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page NotTaskOwnerPage Text :
"P3545894008" "<color orange>"Only your team leader may speak to Sir Lucane."</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page LifeNotDead Text :
"P77057230" "The book... it's in... my mind..."
// Page LifeNotDead SayOutLoudText :
"P2908417682" "The book... it's in... my mind...<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P2870732111" "Attack the Animus Arcana"
// Page LucaneHelped Text :
"P1057351044" "I had sought out the Animus Arcana to aid me in combating the Talons, but all they saw was an opportunity to protect themselves. I would have helped them without their enchantment, but now they have paid a terrible price for their ignorance.<br><br>For now, the best way to help the Animus Arcana is to fight the Talons for them."
// Page LucaneHelped SayOutLoudText :
"P3123568435" "I had sought out the Animus Arcana to aid me in combating the Talons, but all they saw was an opportunity to protect themselves.<t 4>I would have helped them without their enchantment, but now they have paid a terrible price for their ignorance.<t 4>For now, the best way to help the Animus Arcana is to fight the Talons for them.<t 0.1>"
// Page ArcanaHelped Text :
"P1018876552" "Thank you for understanding the plight of others, brave hero. The Animus Arcana need my help more than you do. I am sure you can find others to aid you in your quest, but for now, my quest ends here."
// Page ArcanaHelped SayOutLoudText :
"P2488799569" "Thank you for understanding the plight of others, brave hero.<t 4>The Animus Arcana need my help more than you do.<t 3>I am sure you can find others to aid you in your quest, but for now, my quest ends here.<t 0.1>"
// Page LucaneIncomplete Text :
"P3959110023" "The Animus Arcana need my help. The Talons of Vengeance are hunting them and I have sworn to do everything I can to protect my new spell friends."
// Page LucaneIncomplete SayOutLoudText :
"P1060435409" "The Animus Arcana need my help.<t 3>The Talons of Vengeance are hunting them and I have sworn to do everything I can to protect my new spell friends.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P920904085" "Are you sure they aren't mind controlling you?"
// Answer Text :
"P2165115216" "You're under their spell, Lucane!"
// Page MindControlledPage Text :
"P2798623025" "Mind control? Nonsense. The Animus Arcana are kind and gentle creatures. They would never do such a thing."
// Page MindControlledPage SayOutLoudText :
"P175013260" "Mind control?<t 2>Nonsense.<t 1>The Animus Arcana are kind and gentle creatures.<t 3>They would never do such a thing.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P1657557104" "Well, I guess they do need your protection."
// Answer Text :
"P3614619803" "Fine, we do this the hard way then."
// Page UnderTheirSpellPage Text :
"P214331028" "Under their spell? The only spell I am under is the spell of eternal friendship! These are my friends and they need my help. Now, if you aren't going to be courteous I will have to ask you to leave."
// Page UnderTheirSpellPage SayOutLoudText :
"P3849621457" "Under their spell?<t 2>The only spell I am under is the spell of eternal friendship!<t 4>These are my friends and they need my help.<t 3>Now, if you aren't going to be courteous I will have to ask you to leave.<t 4>"
// Page HelpAnimusArcanaPage Text :
"P4137256515" "Thank you, through them I have found a calling worthy of my abilities."
// Page HelpAnimusArcanaPage SayOutLoudText :
"P2030513383" "Thank you, through them I have found a calling worthy of my abilities.<t 0.1>"
// Page HelpLucanePAge Text :
"P1721710765" "No, please, don't..."
// Page HelpLucanePAge SayOutLoudText :
"P945330092" "No, please, don't...<t 0.1>"

