// IntroString :
"P786920127" "We are few in number, {HeroName}. If we are to show Lorn that the Order is in danger, we must do so with the backing of many sword brothers. <color orange>I believe Sir Emric was seen leading a host of knights into the earth beneath The Digs</color>, no doubt to seek out the Talons and destroy them before they can spread. I suspect that they may be marching to their doom if you do not aid them."
// AcceptString :
"P2981545728" "I will bring back as many of them as I can."
// SendOffString :
"P1127828813" "Thank you, {HeroName}. I know I ask much of you, but you also understand me like no other, for you know the destruction the Talons are capable of first hand. Had I my sword I would go with you and fight at your side, but alas, my exile took both blade and shield. If I am to reclaim them then first I must reclaim my honor."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1177500441" "Find Sir Emric and his host"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3729121680" "I believe Sir Emric may have lead his host of knights into a trap. Find Emric and let him know that he does not fight alone."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P171750865" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: A Worthy Host</color>"

