// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScriptRescueEmric 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P873270656" "Rescue Sir Emric"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P81506971" "You found and rescued Sir Emric, but also learned some disturbing news about the planned fate of the Black Queen."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P496966540" "You rescued Sir Emric, aiding him and his Knights in the annihilation of a great many Talons of Vengeance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2451551083" "Sir Emric and the Knights who survived the battle with the Talons have joined our cause, {HeroName}. He assured me that had your arrival not been so timely, that he would have met his end upon a Gorgon's blade!<br><br>He also gave me these, the blade and shield of a fallen sword brother. I accepted them out of respect for all that Emric and his men sacrificed, but I also made a vow that I would not draw steel until I was made a Knight of the Eternal Order once again...<br><br>I'm not sure what to make of the words of a Talon, but threatening the death of the Black Queen will certainly aid us in turning Lorn to our side."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CarlyleDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page NotTaskOwner Text :
"P1411021796" "<color orange> Let your team leader decide Carlyle's fate.</color>"
// Page TaskCarlyleComplete Text :
"P3065553351" "Oh thank you, I promise I will never betray you ever again!"
// Page TaskCarlyleIncomplete Text :
"P402622924" "Please don't kill me!"
// Answer Text :
"P1376137119" "I'm not going to kill you, Carlyle"
// Answer Text :
"P2086207317" "Then choose your next words very wisely, Carlyle!"
// Page Nice1 Text :
"P964761357" "What? I mean... You aren't?"
// Page Nice1 SayOutLoudText :
"P1464914810" "What?<t 2>I mean...<t 1>You aren't?<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P1162318009" "No, but I want you to tell me everything."
// Page Nice2 Text :
"P1586631424" "Of course, yes, everything! Right...<br><br>Well... After we talked last I had a litt'l visit from Lord Lorn. He had a hunch you'd been chattin' wit Bedwyr... I mean, how else would you 'ave known 'bout the Knights ways and to demand a <i>Trial by Steel</i>?<br><br>By the by, jolly good defeatin' Pendragon...<br><br>At any rate, Lorn figured that, since <i>I</i> was your proxy, that I must know Bedwyr as well..."
// Page Nice2 SayOutLoudText :
"P4133244982" "Of course, yes, everything! Right...<t 3>Well... After we talked last I had a litt'l visit from Lord Lorn.<t 3>He had a hunch you'd been chattin' wit Bedwyr... I mean, how else would you 'ave known 'bout the Knights ways and to demand a Trial by Steel?<t 6>By the by, jolly good defeatin' Pendragon...<t 4>At any rate, Lorn figured that, since I was your proxy, that I must know Bedwyr as well...<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P3766452294" "Oh no..."
// Page Nice3 Text :
"P2779836293" "He made me an offer I simply could not refuse, see...<br><br>I'm dreadfully sorry, {HeroName}, but the Black Knights are already on their way to Bedwyr as we speak."
// Page Nice3 SayOutLoudText :
"P3801519106" "He made me an offer I simply could not refuse, see...<t 3>I'm dreadfully sorry, {HeroName}, but the Black Knights are already on their way to Bedwyr as we speak."
// Answer Text :
"P3124490986" "You get to live this time, Carlyle."
// Answer Text :
"P1231005983" "No, Carlyle, I'm sorry..."
// Page KillCarlyle1 Text :
"P1459243958" "You... You're sorry? Whatever for?"
// Page KillCarlyle1 SayOutLoudText :
"P3254494161" "You...<t 1>You're sorry?<t 2>Whatever for?<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P2622082281" "Because I lied. (Kill Carlyle)"
// Answer Text :
"P2171420210" "Because if Bedwyr dies, you will have to live with that guilt."
// Page Stern1 Text :
"P205542169" "Okay... <br><br>...<br><br>I'm... Sorry?"
// Page Stern1 SayOutLoudText :
"P1152666093" "Okay... <t 2>...<t 3>I'm...<t 2>Sorry?"
// Answer Text :
"P1639304837" "How long have you been working for Lorn and the Black Knights?"
// Page Stern2 Text :
"P1842195271" "Not long, I swear it! I hate those guys, er, present company excluded.<br><br>Listen, Lorn forced me to do it. I didn't want to but he forced me!"
// Page Stern2 SayOutLoudText :
"P2774221135" "Not long, I swear!<t 2>I hate those guys, er, present company excluded.<t 3>Listen, Lorn forced me to do it.<t3>I didn't want to but he forced me!"
// Answer Text :
"P206429996" "Forced you to do what you miserable puke!?"
// Page Stern3 Text :
"P2725528202" "Lorn figured out that we both knew Bedwyr. He made me tell 'im where he's hidin' out 'ere in Night Ward...<br><br>Please don't kill me."
// Page Stern3 SayOutLoudText :
"P1493647528" "Lorn figured out that we both knew Bedwyr.<t 3>He made me tell 'im where he's hidin' out 'ere in Night Ward...<t 3>Please don't kill me."
// Answer Text :
"P3081671699" "Time to die, Carlyle. (Kill him)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - BedwyrDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3824158516" "What?! The Black Knights are on their way here?!"
// Answer Text :
"P762508401" "I'm afraid so, we have to get you out of here."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P2248040756" "<color orange>Bedwyr's hand instinctively goes to his blade.</color><br><br>There's no time, {HeroName}! Though I dread drawing steel against my sword brothers, I see no other choice."
// Answer Text :
"P1497768437" "Right! (Enter Mission)"
// Answer Text :
"P3464561461" "One moment! (Leave)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - BedwyrDialogTree2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2815073669" "You need not die defending me, {HeroName}, run while you still can."
// Answer Text :
"P1462458890" "I'm not leaving you."
// Answer Text :
"P798277089" "Tempting, but I'm not afraid of these guys."
// Page Page1 Text :
"P2455435297" "I am honored that you would choose to fight by my side.<br><br>We'll attack them, it's the last thing they'll expect."
// Page Page1 SayOutLoudText :
"P1956038608" "I am honored that you would choose to fight by my side.<t 4>We'll attack them, it's the last thing they'll expect.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P953185247" "Right, we'll attack together!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PendragonDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page PendragonIncomplete Text :
"P1392811793" "Bedwyr... How did things come to this?<br><br>Lorn branded you a traitor and a coward, yet here you are displaying the honor and loyalty that I have always remembered you by.<br><br>The very same honor which forced you in exile and saved the queen's honor, and my own.<br><br>And in your company is {HeroName}, a warrior who has bested me in battle once before as well. Who brought your words to Lorn when you could not. Surely your words must hold truth to invite an Outsider to risk {Hero.gender=male his|her} life to pass them along for you."
// Page PendragonIncomplete SayOutLoudText :
"P1854902383" "Bedwyr... How did things come to this?<t 3>Lorn branded you a traitor and a coward, yet here you are displaying the honor and loyalty that I have always remembered you by.<t 5>The very same honor which forced you in exile and saved the queen's honor, and my own.<t 5>And in your company is {HeroName}, a warrior who has bested me in battle once before as well.<t 5>They brought your words to Lorn when you could not.<t 3>Surely your words must hold truth to invite an Outsider to risk {Hero.gender=male his|her} life to pass them along for you.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P4235958075" "Pendragon, the Talons cannot be trusted..."
// Page PendragonComplete Text :
"P2043339735" "I must go save the Black Queen!"
// Page NotTaskOwner Text :
"P4010142829" "<color orange>The team leader should talk to Pendragon.</color>"
// Page Page1 Text :
"P1113745484" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_Bedwyr_NoRing width=128 height=128>Listen to {HeroName}, Pendragon. The Talons of Vengeance plot not only to corrupt Lorn, but all of the Black Knights."
// Answer Text :
"P3341709351" "The Talons plot to open the Eternal Prison."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P3148765684" "That cannot be allowed to come to pass! The Eternal Prison dare not be opened!<br><br>Why would Lorn wish to ally with such beings? How can he not see their intent?"
// Page Page2 SayOutLoudText :
"P1888017576" "That cannot be allowed to come to pass!<t 3>The Eternal Prison dare not be opened!<t 3>Why would Lorn wish to ally with such beings?<t 3>How can he not see their intent?<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P1108831361" "His heart may already have been corrupted by their siren song..."
// Page Page3 Text :
"P2105378832" "Impossible! Lorn is the strongest of us. He has served as the Black Warden of the Eternal Order for time immemorable. He was the first of us, and he will be the last..."
// Page Page3 SayOutLoudText :
"P3472949481" "Impossible!<t 2>Lorn is the strongest of us.<t 3>He has served as the Black Warden of the Eternal Order for time immemorable.<t 5>He was the first of us, and he will be the last...<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P4089503380" "Then why send you to kill Bedwyr? What threat is he to Lorn?"
// Page Page4 Text :
"P1314172580" "<img align=left src=costume:Model_Bedwyr_NoRing width=128 height=128>I stained Lorn's honor and the honor of the Black Queen... It was only by Pendragon's word that my life was spared..."
// Answer Text :
"P3462373848" "Stained his honor? Just a moment ago Pendragon praised your honor."
// Page Page5 Text :
"P138062463" "And his honor remains true, for the stain is truly mine to bear. Bedwyr took my dishonor upon himself and sacrificed his place amongst the Black Knights to save me.<br><br>The Queen took pity on Bedwyr that day. She begged Lorn to exile him instead of take his soul. She repaid her debt to you that day as best she could, old friend, but I never could.<br><br>Until Lorn asked for one to hunt you down. I volunteered, so that I might repay my half of the debt as well. But the truth is, at the time, I knew not whether I did so to save you, or to send our secret with you into oblivion...<br><br>I'm sorry, brother, but this dishonor is too great for me to bear any longer... Your name must be restored!"
// Page Page5 SayOutLoudText :
"P3134962896" "And his honor remains true, for the stain is truly mine to bear.<t 5>Bedwyr took my dishonor upon himself and sacrificed his place amongst the Black Knights to save me.<br><br>The Queen took pity on Bedwyr that day.<t 3>She begged Lorn to exile him instead of take his soul.<t 3>She repaid her debt to you that day as best she could, old friend, but I never could.<t 4>Until Lorn asked for one to hunt you down.<t 2>I volunteered, so that I might repay my half of the debt as well.<t 3>But the truth is, at the time, I knew not whether I did so to save you, or to send our secret with you into oblivion...<t 6>I'm sorry, brother, but this dishonor is too great for me to bear any longer...<t 5>Your name must be restored!<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P2779535665" "Wait a second... the Talons were talking about the Black Queen."
// Page Page6 Text :
"P1578561695" "What? Tell me, {HeroName}, what did the Talons say of the Queen?"
// Page Page6 SayOutLoudText :
"P1659206000" "What?<t 2>Tell me, {HeroName}, what did the Talons say of the Queen?"
// Answer Text :
"P273199383" "The Black Queen's is somehow integral to their plans."
// Page Page7 Text :
"P2490267504" "Then she is in grave danger!<br><br><color orange>Pendragon turns toward Bedwyr briefly.</color><br><br>Brother, I must try to save her. Do not try to stop me."
// Page Page7 SayOutLoudText :
"P785474398" "Then she is in grave danger!<t 3>Brother, I must save her.<t 2>Do not try to stop me.<t 0.1>"
// Answer Text :
"P62779215" "(Let Pendragon go.)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - BedwyrDialogTree3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P442269849" "<color deepskyblue>A Matter of Honor</color><br><color deepskyblue>Finale: Act well your part; there all honor lies</color><br><br>We have no choice but to confront Lorn now, before Pendragon gets himself killed.<br><br>There is no time to gather the other Knights. Come, {HeroName}!"
// Answer Text :
"P2402307304" ""I'm ready" (Enter Mission)"
// Answer Text :
"P528653050" ""I'm not ready yet" (Leave)"

