// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScriptDefeatBlackKnights 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P1407305634" "Defeat the Black Knights"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 4 Actor1 :
"P3464676780" "<em=atease t=4 d=4>What poison did Bedwyr whisper to turn you against me?!"
// 3 Actor2 :
"P970200727" "<em=talk t=3 d=3>Truth and honor. Two things I stole from him a long time ago..."
// 3 Actor1 :
"P2059003589" "<em t=2 d=2>What are you saying?"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P1858210641" "<em=talk t=3 d=5>It was not Bedwyr who tried to steal the heart of your queen, my lord."
// 2 Actor3 :
"P186881519" "<em=no t=2 d=2>No... Don't..."
// 3 Actor1 :
"P2212135780" "<em t=3 d=3>What?!"
// 4 Actor2 :
"P4241694500" "<em=talk t=2 d=4>It was me."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P1661333184" "<em=lecture t=3 d=5>And why do you speak of this now, traitor?"
// 6 Actor1 :
"P2226330406" "<em=point t=4 d=6>So you can gloat over the ruin you have wrought on this once great Order?"
// 3 Actor2 :
"P2122239827" "<em=explain t=2 d=3>No, my Lord. I am trying to save it."
// 4 Actor1 :
"P1304488777" "<em=frustrated t=1 d=4>Without loyalty there is no Order to save!"
// 3 Actor2 :
"P1685338242" "<em=talk t=2 d=3>Then I do it to save the queen."
// 6 Actor2 :
"P1620318796" "<em=lecture t=4 d=6>Bedwyr and the Outsider have discovered evidence that she is somehow integral to the Talons plot to open the Eternal Prison."
// 2 Actor1 :
"P1758237737" "<em t=2 d=2>Is that so..?"
// 3 Actor3 :
"P2908347221" "<em=shrug t=3>I... I know not of what Pendragon speaks..."
// 4 Actor2 :
"P2125543280" "<em=lecture t=2 d=4>My Lord, I know this is difficult to hear-"
// 2 Actor1 :
"P2250040045" "<em t=2 d=2>Difficult?"
// 4 Actor1 :
"P3392138635" "<em=disagree t=2 d=4>This is not difficult at all, old friend."
// 4 Actor1 :
"P3936339582" "<em t=4 d=4>I just have to do what I should have done years ago."
// 3 Actor1 :
"P588521638" "<em=point t=3 d=3>Namely, put your head on a spike!"
// 2 Actor3 :
"P182129493" "<em t=2 d=2>Lorn, no!"
// 3 Actor1 :
"P2137318847" "<em=welcome t=2 d=3>And then place her head beside yours!"
// 1 Actor3 :
"P3016766254" "<em t=1 d=1>*Gasp*"
// 4 Actor2 :
"P2409457260" "<em=point t=4>I will see you dead before you harm her!"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P1545251953" "<em=point t=3 d=5>And I will gladly die before I let this Order's honor be further stained by the two of you!"
// 4 Actor1 :
"P490465762" "<em=angry t=3 d=4>If I am to save the Order then I must cut off the rotten limbs!"
// 3 Actor1 :
"P933951547" "<em t=2 d=3>Defend yourself, Pendragon, and let none interfere!"
// 1 Actor2 :
"P1305152100" "<em t=2 d=3>If it must come to this then so be it!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_3_NAME :
"P3643637544" "Black Queen"

