// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3448209632" "Ah ha ha ha ha ha!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2248323277" "<t 3>Finally... I have waited for this day for a long time, my Lord..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3924665729" "Now DIE!<t 3>Ah ha ha ha ha ha!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P752512907" "Pendragon, my love.<t 2>Now that Lorn is dead we can finally be together...<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2030762497" "There is no need to hide your feelings any longer, my love.<t 3>Now you can take your rightful place by my side.<t 3>Isn't that what you wanted?<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P659398406" "<em=laugh>Ha ha ha ha ha...<t 2><em=point>I didn't say YOU would be head of the Order, Pendragon.<t 5>By marriage that honor falls to me...<t 3>And with it comes the authority to open the Eternal Prison.<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2494391517" "Such a handsome boy, but not very bright.<t 4>What a pity. You were a good lover, but, your part has been played and you are no longer of any use to me.<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2335406907" "It's far too late for you to be the strong hero, Pendragon.<t 3>Everyone here is dead by your hand, or the hands of a traitor and an Outsider.<t 5>The Black Knights follow me now...<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1473580069" "Sir Pendragon"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2930344597" "What have you done?!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P188591932" "Lorn threatened to kill you!<t 3>I never wanted to take his place as head of the Order!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P321791670" "It was you!<t 2>You were working for the Talons this whole time?!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2815714112" "You'll not get away with this!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2386973881" "I... I have betrayed my oaths, I have betrayed my master, and I have betrayed myself.<t 5>Bedwyr, {HeroName}... <t 3>I am fit to be a Black Knight no longer.<t 4>Take my shield and take my sword. Until I have found my true calling, I shall not need them anymore.<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4018600955" "Nobody interfere.<t 1>I will deal with the Outsider personally!<t 0.1>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3726960691" "You are beaten!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1802972599" "Knights! Help me..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P453980874" "GAAAAAH!!!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4008794701" "You saved Pendragon's life, but Lord Lorn was betrayed and killed by the Black Queen who you discovered is working with the Talons of Vengeance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4228811944" "I still cannot believe that the Black Queen was working with the Talons this entire time. With Lorn dead the means of opening the Eternal Prison has now passed on to her. She can open the prison, {HeroName}, and release all kinds of evil upon Night Ward. But I fear there is something even more sinister at work here that we can't see yet.<br><br>I must concentrate on rallying those Knights still free of the Black Queen's control. They must know the truth of things. However, perhaps there is someone who can help you. <color orange>A mysterious magician with no name.</color>"

